// A beat the game starts or calls by name can be marked public. Anywhere
// else, `public` is an ordinary word: a state field, or the start of a line
// of text.

state
  public: "the crowd"

public beat EnterShop
  public opinion is low.

  The $public cheers.

  -> Leave

beat Leave
  Bye.

/*
<test>
- expected: |
    ~ public opinion is low.

    ~ The the crowd cheers.

    ~ Bye.
- beat: Leave
  expected: |
    ~ Bye.
</test>
*/
